Step 4. Create the React Client (Frontend)

1. In the “client” folder, create a new React app. (You can use Create React App for simplicity.)

   (in terminal)
   $ cd ../client
   $ npx create-react-app .

2. Install axios for making HTTP requests:

   $ npm install axios

3. Replace the contents of src/App.js with the following code:

